//api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1031,"digest":"sha256:b64c1ccac52cac04dc3c456983c0a397bc1f0cd51d1b4ac10afc25930a09269d","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T03:28:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T03:28:41Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.4.6/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.4.6","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.4.6","body":"# 释手 0.4.6\n\n本次修正通用听写上屏链路，覆盖 Codex 等应用，继续复用现有模型。\n\n- 普通本机应用统一优先使用可验证的原生「粘贴」命令，不再依赖按应用名称配置的名单。\n- 只有完整检查确认没有该命令时，才进行一次键盘回退；菜单禁用、查询异常、目标变化或已尝试但结果未确认时不再派发第二次。\n- 键盘回退补齐 Command 按下、V 按下／松开、Command 松开，并定向发送到已核对的进程，替换仅给 V 标注 Command 的旧实现。回填前若用户仍按住修饰键，则保留文字供手动粘贴。\n- 合成事件加上专用标记，避免被释手自己的快捷键或回填保护误认作用户操作。\n- UU 远程保留原有同步等待与 HID 投递方式，并使用完整的快捷键序列。\n\nF16／脚踏板、识别和整理方式、个人设置及模型沿用。在「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新」升级即可。\n"}
